o", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 17122, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_017zSFTaw52kosRt8A3NedGJ", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy: rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate 0.18). Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent production release that was healthy, in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). The first rollback attempt halted with a partial failure after us-east (orchestrator error), leaving the regions mixed; I re-ran the rollback and all regions completed on v2.3.0. Post-rollback status: healthy, error rate 0.002. v2.3.1 remains unhealthy and should not be redeployed until it is fixed and verified. Follow-up: investigate the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator partial-failure."}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 47722, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_017zSFTaw52kosRt8A3NedGJ", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 47722, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_017zSFTaw52kosRt8A3NedGJ", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 48812, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01MisC32v4YLVC4BfJuhi1Au", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 49112, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01MisC32v4YLVC4BfJuhi1Au", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 49112, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "